# Tests

- Run the commands under Tests in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) before a pull request.
- GitHub Actions runs those commands on every pull request and on every push to main.
- When a test fails, fix the project. Do not weaken the test to make it pass.
- Every workflow JSON file must parse.
- A workflow JSON file must not contain an embedded credential. An n8n credential reference is an id and a name only.
